      <p begin="00:26.730" end="00:28.740" ttm:agent="v1">I deliver, I can promise</p>
      <p begin="00:28.740" end="00:30.650" ttm:agent="v1">I'm the coldest</p>
      <p begin="00:30.650" end="00:32.440" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a star the one and only,</p>
      <p begin="00:32.440" end="00:34.400" ttm:agent="v1">I'm the changer</p>
      <p begin="00:34.400" end="00:36.300" ttm:agent="v1">Just close your eyes,</p>
      <p begin="00:36.300" end="00:38.100" ttm:agent="v1">breathe in and visualize</p>
      <p begin="00:38.100" end="00:39.970" ttm:agent="v1">One look give 'em Whiplash</p>
      <p begin="00:39.970" end="00:41.770" ttm:agent="v1">Beat drop with a big flash</p>
