      <p begin="01:07.430" end="01:09.100" ttm:agent="v1">One look give 'em Whiplash</p>
      <p begin="01:09.100" end="01:10.630" ttm:agent="v1">Fancy</p>
      <p begin="01:10.630" end="01:12.130" ttm:agent="v1">This is opulence,</p>
      <p begin="01:11.700" end="01:14.320" ttm:agent="v1">it's glowing and it's flashy</p>
      <p begin="01:14.320" end="01:16.130" ttm:agent="v1">Never one to do too much,</p>
      <p begin="01:16.130" end="01:18.040" ttm:agent="v1">I keep it classy</p>
      <p begin="01:18.040" end="01:19.840" ttm:agent="v1">I'm not the 1, the 2, or 3,</p>
      <p begin="01:19.840" end="01:21.710" ttm:agent="v1">so don't you ask me</p>
      <p begin="01:21.710" end="01:23.960" ttm:agent="v1">Feel free to gas me Ya</p>
      <p begin="01:23.960" end="01:25.460" ttm:agent="v1">Under pressure,</p>
