      <p begin="01:35.220" end="01:37.280" ttm:agent="v1">Just close your eyes,</p>
      <p begin="01:37.280" end="01:39.970" ttm:agent="v1">breathe in and visualize</p>
      <p begin="01:39.970" end="01:42.040" ttm:agent="v1">If you want it on-site</p>
      <p begin="01:42.040" end="01:43.960" ttm:agent="v1">Push the button just right</p>
      <p begin="01:43.960" end="01:45.850" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah you see it one time</p>
      <p begin="01:45.850" end="01:47.740" ttm:agent="v1">Unforgettable</p>
      <p begin="01:47.740" end="01:49.600" ttm:agent="v1">When we hit the right light</p>
      <p begin="01:49.600" end="01:51.560" ttm:agent="v1">I'll be stuck in your mind</p>
      <p begin="01:51.560" end="01:53.410" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah you see it one time</p>
